      "content": "i know, i'm just really worried about the bill for an er visit and im also kinda tired of all the doctors calling me every time my numbers fluctuate. is there even a way to just balance it out with diet? like if i just eat a lot of spinach or something would that fix it? it doesn't seem that bad, just a little dizzy.",
