      "content": "wait, you said spinach would raise it? i thought vitamin k actually helps blood clot so wouldn't eating more of it help lower my inr? like if the warfarin is making my blood too thin, shouldn't i just load up on greens to counteract it? if i just ate a huge salad or took a supplement i could probably get it back down to 2.5 by tomorrow morning without the hospital visit. can i just do that?",
